<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan Telecom rises 7.17 percent.</title>
<headline>Pakistan Telecom rises 7.17 percent.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan Telecommunication Company Ltd (PTCL) 10-rupee stock rose 2.75 rupees, or 7.17 percent, to 41.10 on Monday on strong buying by overseas fund managers, dealers at the Karachi Stock Exchange (KSE) said.</p>
<p>Some 30 million shares changed hands in early trade mainly on foreign buying, dealer Ali Raza Mooney said.</p>
<p>($1 = 40.62 rupees)</p>
<p>-- Ibrahim Khan 9221-5685192</p>
